From 62cec6795b862ac46d6f7898a4f5e7f8b5a39d9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:49:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] phase10.7: make BBRv3 the default congestion control

Set DEFAULT_BBR3=y so the kernel boots with bbr3 by default. cubic and bbr remain available. Gates: 7298 baseline symbols unchanged, 355 vendor modules 0 failures, boot; tcp_congestion_control is bbr3 without any runtime sysctl.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
index 134fac1be..0a49ec59b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -891,3 +891,7 @@ CONFIG_TMPFS_POSIX_ACL=y
 
 # Phase 10.6: BBRv3.
 CONFIG_TCP_CONG_BBR3=y
+
+# Phase 10.7: make BBRv3 the default congestion control.
+CONFIG_DEFAULT_BBR3=y
+# CONFIG_DEFAULT_CUBIC is not set
